# typed-member ctree audit. Direct loads/address computations carry their first
# register consumer on every normal path; residual predicate/store/transfer
# anchors carry the backwards-reaching source of the consumed lane. Aggregate
# LDP/STP expressions expand to two physical lanes, so 311 semantic rows become
# 268 producer lanes plus 45 anchor lanes.
