# Complete Hex-Rays cot_num surface for the 114 MANIFEST functions.  This is
# deliberately separate from the raw AArch64 immediate-operand census: ctree
# numbers include source-facing constants realized by loads, stores and
# condition-select instructions, while machine immediates also contain
# compiler-created frame offsets, address materialization and system-register
# selectors.  Each compact row records the owner-local ordinal, immediate
# parent, decompiler type, concrete/synthetic EA, nearest emitted realization
# anchor, exact word and unsigned 64-bit value.  The trailing digest pins the
# complete 132,066-byte textual ctree sequence, including the number and parent
# expressions, without treating ARM64 object/layout offsets as portable source
# tokens.
