# Complete Hex-Rays local-variable declaration/use surface.  This remains
# separate from the AArch64 stack-frame contract: optimized register lvars,
# unused ABI parameters and SROA temporaries are decompiler evidence, while
# only stack allocation/save/cleanup instructions are machine layout facts.
# LVS1 stores every lvar declaration plus every cot_var occurrence and ties
# definition/use anchors back to exact words in the authoritative ARM64 ELF.
# Call relations identify the concrete child occurrence: equal-effect lvars
# may legally occupy both arg0 and a later argument of the same call.
