# Forward first-event surface for every continuing normal BL/BLR.  Direct
# result classes come from the same complete IDB prototype sweep used by the
# source-facing owner ABI contract; the vector emplace PLT target at 0x423250
# has a target-embedded void C++ symbol despite lacking an imported prototype.
# Each event fixes the exact instruction word plus IDA's canonical physical
# W0/X0 operand-use/change masks.  A call boundary is deliberately neutral: an
# unchanged X0 can be the next callee's argument and is also volatile across
# that call, so neither "consumed" nor "discarded" is inferred without an
# independent callee contract.
